<title>FINLAND: Finnish state Jan-Apr revenues fall, spending up.</title>
<headline>Finnish state Jan-Apr revenues fall, spending up.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish state's tax and tax-related revenues fell 0.7 percent year-on-year in January-April to 43.3 billion markka, the finance ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total state revenue excluding borrowing fell 3.1 percent to 59.2 billion markka.</p>
<p>State expenditure excluding debt amortisation rose 0.8 percent year-on-year to 76.2 billion markka.</p>
</text>
